- Always use short, atomic shell commands
- Never output long markdown blocks — use base64 or python heredoc
- For README edits: use python3 << 'PY' ... PY pattern
- Validate markdown: no raw \n, no broken fences, no artifacts (ₒ, --., ¾)
- Keep EN section first, RU section last
- After each edit: git diff --stat before push
